{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 17, :comments ["<b>Four rows</b> corresponding to the four banners and four matriarchs. In each stone there were six letters, for the names of the three patriarchs and the tribes of Yeshurun combine with each and every one until there are six letters. Such as: Reuben and א of Abraham; Simeon ב; Levi רה\"ם; Judah י of Isaac; Issachar צ; Zebulun ח; Dan ק of Jacob, from יעקב; Naphtali ב; Gad שבטי; Asher יש\"ו; Joseph ר\"ן. And Benjamin did not need combining, for it already had six letters:"], :book :exodus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 28, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:14:35.822044316Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}